'''Cli-One''' (破壊生物クオリネン, ''Hakai Seibutsu Kuorinen'', '''Destruction Being Kuolinen''') is an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy first seen as the boss of the [[Moon (Into the Future)|Moon]] in [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1. Later, she reappears in [[Cats of the Cosmos]] and [[Legend Stages]]. She was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]].

